1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
gsuda-engine is a provenance-first
self-evolving trading loop.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:15,000
It turns failed trading outcomes
into validated risk rules.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Built from 23 years of Korean
securities-system experience.

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:30,000
And 13 years of Saju and Yeokhak
study as feature engineering.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,500
This is not fortune-telling.
Every rule must pass validation.

6
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:45,000
The recording uses the API-free path
for fast, reproducible judging.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,500
The command runs the full closed loop:
trade log, outcomes, clusters, rules.

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:01:00,000
Stage 1 logs full feature vectors:
technicals, Saju pillars, and Hanja.

9
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,500
Stage 2 tags T+5 outcomes:
wins, losses, and stopped-out trades.

10
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:15,000
Stage 3 clusters failures and drafts
candidate YAML plus markdown skills.

11
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:22,500
Stage 4 validates each rule against
historical matches and winner damage.

12
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:30,000
Result: one rule is promoted,
and one rule is quarantined.

13
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,500
The active rule is now a Risk Guardian
skill loaded from `skills/active`.

14
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:45,000
Its judge-facing Saju label is English:
Metal Goat.

15
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:52,500
The machine validation key is compact:
MetalGoat.

16
00:01:52,500 --> 00:02:00,000
The original Hanja, 辛未, is preserved
as domain provenance.

17
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:07,500
The rule records trigger conditions,
failure cases, and backtest statistics.

18
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:15,000
It passed the validation gate,
so Risk Guardian can deploy it.

19
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:22,500
The quarantined rule shows why
the gate matters.

20
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:30,000
It matched history, but damaged
too many winning trades.

21
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:37,500
So the system keeps it visible,
but blocks deployment.

22
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:45,000
The local research warehouse spans
Korean equities from 1995 to 2026.

23
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:52,500
It contains 11M+ enriched rows
and 2,700+ stocks.

24
00:02:52,500 --> 00:03:00,000
Claude drafts. Data validates.
Risk Guardian deploys.
